  "ingredients": [
    "4 ounce bacon",
    "6 large egg",
    "salt and pepper (to taste)",
    "4 tablespoon cheddar cheese (shredded)",
    "2 tablespoon sour cream",
    "2 tablespoon green onion (chopped)"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Gather and prep all ingredients. Cut the bacon into small pieces.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/loaded-keto-breakfast-bowl/#wprm-recipe-54781-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Loaded-Breakfast-Bowl-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a pan over medium-low heat, fry the bacon until crisp and fat rendered. Remove bacon from pan, leaving fat, and set aside.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/loaded-keto-breakfast-bowl/#wprm-recipe-54781-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Loaded-Breakfast-Bowl-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a bowl, whisk the eggs. If you prefer fluffier eggs, you can add a squirt of water to them as well.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/loaded-keto-breakfast-bowl/#wprm-recipe-54781-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Loaded-Breakfast-Bowl-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the eggs into the pan and slowly scramble them, being sure to not overmix.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/loaded-keto-breakfast-bowl/#wprm-recipe-54781-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Loaded-Breakfast-Bowl-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Season with salt and pepper, then transfer to a bowl. Add the cooked bacon, cheddar cheese, sour cream, and green onion. Enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/loaded-keto-breakfast-bowl/#wprm-recipe-54781-step-0-4",
